EN:
I might be overstepping my bounds,
but if you're tired, don't push it.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Be sure you get some rest, OK?!

IT:
Scusa se mi intrometto, ma...
Se sei stanc{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}, prendila con calma.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}E riposati! OK?

TRANSLATION:
Belki haddimi aşıyorum ama
yorgunsan kendini zorlama.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}İyice dinlen, tamam mı?!
